  "body": "Auction: 2/2 Dunrobin Place, Highland Park (Branch office) on Tuesday 8 December 2026 at 2:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nWhether you’re stepping onto the property ladder, looking to downsize or seeking a smart investment opportunity, set on a freehold title, this well-maintained brick and weatherboard home offers comfort, convenience and easy-care living in a sought-after location.\r\n\r\nInside, you’ll find three generous-sized bedrooms, serviced by a family bathroom and a separate toilet for added convenience. The sunny, formal living room provides a welcoming space to relax, while the separate dining area flows seamlessly into the modern kitchen, complete with gas cooking. From the dining area, step out onto the deck, perfect for enjoying your morning coffee or entertaining family and friends.\r\n\r\nOutside, easy-care gardens keep weekend maintenance to a minimum, while off-street parking adds further practicality. Presented in tidy condition, this home is ready to move in and enjoy, with scope to make it your own over time.\r\n\r\nWithin walking distance to local schools, shops and bus stops, everyday convenience is right at your doorstep. Families will appreciate the excellent school zoning, including Wakaaranga Primary School, Farm Cove Intermediate and Pakuranga College. A short drive takes you to Half Moon Bay Marina, while Highland Park shopping centre, supermarkets and a range of everyday amenities are also close by.\r\n\r\nAn excellent opportunity for first-home buyers, downsizers and savvy investors alike. Comfortable, convenient and easy to maintain – this is one you won’t want to miss!",
